    <div class="hrdp-program">
        <div class="hrdp-program-intro">
            <h1>In-house Phenotyping Pilot Program</h1>
            <p>Combine the genetic diversity of the Hybrid Rat Discovery Panel with the expertise of MCW&rsquo;s core
                facilities to generate robust preliminary data to support your future studies and grant applications.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="hrdp-program-details">
            <h4>Program Highlights</h4>
            <ul>
                <li>Flexible study design based on investigator needs</li>
                <li>Phenotyping performed by the HRDP team &amp; MCW Cores</li>
                <li>Standardized protocols for high-quality, reproducible data</li>
                <li>Tissue collection for future analyses</li>
            </ul>
            <h4>Phenotyping Services</h4>
            <ul class="two-columns">
                <li>Blood, urine &amp; tissue collections</li>
                <li>Glucose tolerance testing</li>
                <li>Clinical chemistry</li>
                <li>Diet interventions</li>
                <li>Organ weights</li>
                <li>Metabolic phenotyping</li>
                <li>Behavioral phenotyping</li>
                <li>Drug exposure studies</li>
            </ul>
            <h4>Program Details</h4>
            <ul>
                <li>Request up to 40 rats (4 strains, 10 rats per strain)</li>
                <li>Requests can vary by strain, age, sex &amp; protocol</li>
                <li>Phenotyping completed by ~10 weeks of age</li>
                <li>Two projects awarded per cycle</li>
                <li>Two competitive application cycles per year</li>
            </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="hrdp-program-side">
            <div class="hrdp-application-info">
                <h5>APPLICATION INFORMATION</h5>
                <p>Applications Now Open</p>
                <p>Deadline:<br><span class="hrdp-info-value">December 18, 2026</span></p>
                <p>Phenotyping completed:<br><span class="hrdp-info-value">Spring-Summer 2027</span></p>
                <p class="hrdp-questions">Questions? Contact the HRDP team at <a href="mailto:hrdp@mcw.edu">hrdp@mcw.edu</a></p>
            </div>
